OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv weapons depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour children are among 42 people
OL,7,Finjured, according to regional head
OL,8,FTymur Tkachenko, with a rescue
OL,9,Foperation ongoing at the site in the
OL,10,FBucha district on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
